OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer faces court over
OL,4,Adriving offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Leeds United footballer Ian
OL,7,FPoveda has appeared in court charged
OL,8,Fwith several driving offences.
OL,10,FPoveda, who currently plays for
OL,11,FAtletico Nacional in Colombia's first
OL,12,Fdivision, denied four counts of
OL,13,Fperverting the course of justice and a
OL,14,Ffurther two counts of fraud when he
OL,15,Fappeared at Leeds Crown Court via video
OL,16,Flink earlier.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
