OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer faces court over
OL,4,Adriving offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old is accused of failing
OL,7,Fto disclose a driving disqualification
OL,8,Fin order to obtain insurance,
OL,9,Fdisplaying false number plates and
OL,10,Fconspiring to obtain insurance in
OL,11,Fsomeone else's name for a car he
OL,12,Fintended to drive while disqualified.
OL,14,FJudge Robin Mairs set a trial date of 4
OL,15,FDecember 2028.
